ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp065: PLANE face; bottom edge PCurve is a POLYLINE with 5 CPs (0,0)->(0.5,0)->(1,1)->(2,0.5)->(5,0); GetEndTangent2d reads last-two-points giving tangent (3,-0.5) instead of first-segment (1,0); 3D curve is B-spline with C-1 positional break at t=0.5 (knot mult=3, CP[2]=(0,0,0) vs CP[3]=(5,0,0)) */
